WHAT THESE NUMBERS REST ON - every inference, named:
   [HEIGHT_FROM_STOREY] walls and columns are priced over the full rise from their own storey to the next floor above it. A member the drawings stop short of that floor is over-measured by the difference.
   [WALL_VARIANT_UNSPLIT] shear and non-shear walls are not distinguished, so every wall takes the default reinforcing ratio. The generator gives every wall a pier label, so a pier cannot be used as evidence of a shear wall. Split by hand where it matters.
